{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNg7MomkHkV8ycsjnxPj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The change does what T2 asks and nothing it forbids.\n\n- **Overdraw:** `remove` now raises `ValueError` when `qty` is greater than the stock for that SKU. An unknown SKU counts as 0 in stock, so any positive removal from one raises.\n- **Unchanged on refusal:** the check runs before any write, so a refused removal leaves the stock as it was.\n- **Exact removal:** `qty == stock` passes the check, and the subtraction leaves 0.\n- **Scope:** the diff touches only `Ledger.remove`. It keeps the existing `qty <= 0` check and adds nothing else.\n\nI judged this from the diff and task statement alone and did not run any tests.\n\nWIP-REVIEW WIP-NONCE:ad2be4f8d3de6173 b93600655552c35de96d6482659116973e7ea7a4 approve\n\nOPEN_FLEET_WORKER_DONE disp_594b353098 succeeded"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":746,"cache_read_input_tokens":17686,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":746,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"40f2dd83-9c9f-4892-9899-3af00bf5c988","uuid":"16bbdc38-4c29-4187-b920-dabd216a9eef","timestamp":"2026-10-25T08:55:17.903Z","request_id":"req_011CgNg7MaPZrckzosjn2fpi"}
